escribe: the largest model file read. A larger one is limit.input-too-large. predict from standard input (the operand - or none): the CSV is held in memory, so this is also the most bytes of standard input read. More is limit.input-too-large\"},\"dir\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"description\":\"the directory of run records, relative to the server's root\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"description\":\"a run id: 64 lowercase hexadecimal digits\"}},\"required\":[\"dir\",\"id\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"outputSchema\":{\"$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"One JSON object on one line. ok is false exactly when errors is present; error is its first element. A dry run (fit --dry-run) has ok true, exit 9, dry_run and planned_actions. No float appears: every decimal is a string with its digits exact.\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"ok\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"command\":{\"const\":\"ml\"},\"schema\":{\"const\":\"ml.v1\"},\"data\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/data\"},\"dry_run\":{\"const\":true},\"planned_actions\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"op\":{\"enum\":[\"create\",\"replace\"]},\"path\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/text_or_bytes\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0},\"sha256\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\"}},\"required\":[\"op\",\"path\",\"bytes\",\"sha256\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"op\":{\"const\":\"create\"},\"dir\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/text_or_bytes\"},\"file\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/text_or_bytes\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0},\"sha256\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\"}},\"required\":[\"op\",\"dir\",\"file\",\"bytes\",\"sha256\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}]}},\"error\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/error\"},\"errors\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/error\"},\"minItems\":1},\"meta\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/me